WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.427 --> 00:00:02.193
- I'm here to show my boyfriend

00:00:02.193 --> 00:00:04.355
what a bloody pad looks like.

00:00:04.355 --> 00:00:06.855
(light music)

00:00:08.929 --> 00:00:10.848
I've had my period for about eleven years,

00:00:10.848 --> 00:00:15.406
and that's roughly 2600
used menstrual products

00:00:15.406 --> 00:00:18.047
that I've had in my lifetime.

00:00:18.047 --> 00:00:20.121
- [Interviewer] And how
many do you estimate

00:00:20.121 --> 00:00:21.269
Steven has seen?

00:00:21.269 --> 00:00:23.666
- Steve has seen maybe six,

00:00:23.666 --> 00:00:26.398
if I did a good job of hiding them.

00:00:26.398 --> 00:00:29.551
- My knowledge of women's
ovulation is pretty,

00:00:29.551 --> 00:00:31.998
I would consider it average for men.

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:35.167
- Whenever I'm on my period I
definitely go in another room.

00:00:35.167 --> 00:00:36.854
In terms of the bloody side of things,

00:00:36.854 --> 00:00:39.013
I try to hide it from
him most of the time.

00:00:39.013 --> 00:00:41.374
I think it's just been
ingrained in my system that

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:43.602
it's an embarrassing
thing to have your period.

00:00:43.602 --> 00:00:45.585
- I mean I grew up with one sister,

00:00:45.585 --> 00:00:48.174
but my sister was pretty good at

00:00:48.174 --> 00:00:51.307
kind of hiding that part of her.

00:00:51.307 --> 00:00:54.440
- I think I'm probably more embarrassed

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:58.235
for him to see it than he's gonna be.

00:00:58.235 --> 00:01:00.735
(light music)

00:01:03.707 --> 00:01:08.096
So this is a pad from sort
of the end of my period,

00:01:08.096 --> 00:01:11.248
so I'd say it's a little
bit of a lighter flow.

00:01:11.248 --> 00:01:12.489
Then I show it?

00:01:12.489 --> 00:01:13.488
Alright.

00:01:13.488 --> 00:01:14.704
- Alright, here we go.

00:01:14.704 --> 00:01:15.704
- Enjoy.

00:01:15.704 --> 00:01:16.704
(laughs)

00:01:16.704 --> 00:01:18.285
- Alright, this is it?

00:01:18.285 --> 00:01:20.030
- That's it, that's a light day.

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:22.027
- Oh, oh god, oh my,

00:01:22.027 --> 00:01:24.335
just kidding, I'm kidding, come on.

00:01:24.335 --> 00:01:25.789
- Really?

00:01:25.789 --> 00:01:27.045
- Okay.

00:01:27.045 --> 00:01:27.878
I mean.

00:01:29.274 --> 00:01:31.452
- You've probably dissected worse.

00:01:31.452 --> 00:01:32.693
- For some reason I was imagining

00:01:32.693 --> 00:01:34.798
you were gonna hold up like a small Ziploc

00:01:34.798 --> 00:01:36.762
like filled to the brim with blood

00:01:36.762 --> 00:01:38.311
and I wouldn't even be able to,

00:01:38.311 --> 00:01:40.325
I don't know why, I know
that's not even possible,

00:01:40.325 --> 00:01:41.911
I mean maybe that's possible.

00:01:41.911 --> 00:01:44.411
(light music)

00:01:49.646 --> 00:01:51.660
So over the course of like
a period that you have,

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:54.127
if you're wearing a pad,
is this the normal amount?

00:01:54.127 --> 00:01:55.190
- This is lighter.

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:58.016
- I keep turning it over
expecting to see something new.

00:01:58.016 --> 00:02:02.183
So I was imagining, I was
imagining like blood red,

00:02:03.448 --> 00:02:07.175
like what you imagine the
reddest of the red to be.

00:02:07.175 --> 00:02:09.675
(light music)

00:02:22.818 --> 00:02:25.228
- It's sad how, when
I first got my period,

00:02:25.228 --> 00:02:28.645
how ashamed I was feeling about it

00:02:28.645 --> 00:02:31.045
because guys used to give me shit for

00:02:31.045 --> 00:02:33.413
tampons and pads that didn't
even have blood on them,

00:02:33.413 --> 00:02:35.815
like I would have to like
subtly hide it in my shirt

00:02:35.815 --> 00:02:36.977
when I went to the bathroom.

00:02:36.977 --> 00:02:38.579
I just think that's like so weird when,

00:02:38.579 --> 00:02:42.329
it's such a natural
thing that we go through.

00:02:44.433 --> 00:02:47.524
I'm very relieved that Steve's
handled it so maturely.

00:02:47.524 --> 00:02:48.711
- What I learned through this

00:02:48.711 --> 00:02:51.467
actually had less to
do with the pad itself

00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:55.716
than learning what your thoughts
were, like going into it,

00:02:55.716 --> 00:02:58.341
that you have been more uncomfortable

00:02:58.341 --> 00:03:00.232
than I even realized.

00:03:00.232 --> 00:03:01.440
- I would say that I'm relieved

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.719
that Steve has seen it up close.

00:03:03.719 --> 00:03:07.379
I think there's a way
to be still respectful

00:03:07.379 --> 00:03:09.193
and not wanting to see this.

00:03:09.193 --> 00:03:12.527
If you're dating somebody
and you accidentally

00:03:12.527 --> 00:03:16.498
have a period that gets a stain somewhere,

00:03:16.498 --> 00:03:17.954
I think there's a way to be nice about it

00:03:17.954 --> 00:03:20.333
and still be kind of squeamish.

00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:21.645
- What if I just vomited on the table?

00:03:21.645 --> 00:03:22.644
That would've been.

00:03:22.644 --> 00:03:23.643
- That would be so awkward.

00:03:23.643 --> 00:03:25.298
- We would've had a lot
of therapy to get through.

00:03:25.298 --> 00:03:27.798
(light music)

